1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,778
Lepakshi ka mashhoor latakta khamba,

2
00:00:01,778 --> 00:00:04,268
asal mein poora hawa mein nahi hai.

3
00:00:04,268 --> 00:00:08,536
Jaanch mein paaya gaya ki iska bas kona zameen ko chhoota hai.

4
00:00:08,536 --> 00:00:12,093
Phir bhi log uske neeche se kapda nikaal dete hain.

5
00:00:12,093 --> 00:00:15,650
Toh yeh chamatkar hai, galti hai, ya kamaal ki engineering?

6
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,150
Andhra Pradesh ke Lepakshi gaon mein Veerabhadra mandir khada hai.

7
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,900
Iske khambon wale hall mein,

8
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,350
baaki khambe chhat ko sambhaale khade hain.

9
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:26,150
Lekin unke beech yeh khamba alag dikhta hai.

10
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:29,300
Log kehte hain yeh khamba hawa mein latakta hai,

11
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,100
jaise kisi ne use upar utha liya ho.

12
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,589
Is video mein hum sabut ke saath chalenge.

13
00:00:34,589 --> 00:00:37,078
Shuru mein dekhenge ki granth kya kehta hai.

14
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:38,945
Phir dekhenge jaanch mein kya mila,

15
00:00:38,945 --> 00:00:40,812
jaankar kahan alag raay rakhte hain,

16
00:00:40,812 --> 00:00:43,612
aur kya abhi tak koi nahi jaanta. Aakhir mein,

17
00:00:43,612 --> 00:00:45,790
aap wahan jaakar kya dekh sakte hain.

18
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:49,801
Kahani shuru hoti hai Skanda Purana se. Purana yaani prachin granth,

19
00:00:49,801 --> 00:00:53,083
jismein devtaon, teerthon aur jagahon ki kathayein likhi hain.

20
00:00:53,083 --> 00:00:56,001
Is granth mein Lepakshi ka naam aata hai,

21
00:00:56,001 --> 00:00:58,553
aur bade aadar ke saath aata hai.

22
00:00:58,553 --> 00:01:02,200
Yahin se is jagah ki pavitrata ki neev padti hai.

23
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:05,758
Skanda Purana ke mutabik, Lepakshi divyakshetron mein se hai.

24
00:01:05,758 --> 00:01:07,735
Divyakshetra yaani aisi pavitra bhoomi,

25
00:01:07,735 --> 00:01:10,898
jahan devta ki khaas upasthiti maani jaati hai.

26
00:01:10,898 --> 00:01:15,247
Yeh jagah Bhagwan Shiv ke mahatvapurna teerthon mein gini jaati hai.

27
00:01:15,247 --> 00:01:18,410
Isliye yahan sadiyon se shraddhalu aate rahe hain.

28
00:01:18,410 --> 00:01:22,567
Yeh mandir Veerabhadra ko samarpit hai. Puranon ki kathaon mein Veerabhadra,

29
00:01:22,567 --> 00:01:25,212
Shiv ka ugra roop maane jaate hain.

30
00:01:25,212 --> 00:01:28,613
Garbhagriha mein door se patthar ki moorti dikhti hai,

31
00:01:28,613 --> 00:01:32,015
deep ki roshni mein. Shraddhalu haath jode khade hain,

32
00:01:32,015 --> 00:01:34,660
aur hawa mein agarbatti ki khushboo hai.

33
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:37,397
Gaon ke naam ke peeche bhi kahani hai.

34
00:01:37,397 --> 00:01:38,766
Lok katha kehti hai,

35
00:01:38,766 --> 00:01:41,503
Ramayan mein ghayal Jatayu pakshi yahin gire the.

36
00:01:41,503 --> 00:01:45,266
Shri Ram ne kaha, 'Le Pakshi', yaani utho pakshi. Wahi shabd,

37
00:01:45,266 --> 00:01:49,030
kehte hain, aage chalkar is gaon ka naam Lepakshi ban gaya.

38
00:01:49,030 --> 00:01:51,940
Ab aate hain mandir banwane wale Virupanna par.

39
00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:53,394
Lok katha ke mutabik,

40
00:01:53,394 --> 00:01:56,304
raja ke mantriyon ne un par ilzaam lagaya.

41
00:01:56,304 --> 00:02:00,668
Ilzaam tha ki unhone shahi khazane ka paisa mandir par uda diya.

42
00:02:00,668 --> 00:02:03,214
Yeh ilzaam, kahani kehti hai, jhootha tha,

43
00:02:03,214 --> 00:02:05,760
aur galat salaah par lagaya gaya tha.

44
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,144
Kahani aage kehti hai,

45
00:02:07,144 --> 00:02:10,949
sazaa ka andaza lagakar Virupanna ne khud apni aankhein nikaal di.

46
00:02:10,949 --> 00:02:13,717
Unhone unhe mandir ki deewar par phenk diya.

47
00:02:13,717 --> 00:02:17,176
Aaj bhi deewar par laal se nishaan dikhaye jaate hain.

48
00:02:17,176 --> 00:02:20,290
Log inhe Virupanna ki aankhon ke nishaan kehte hain.

49
00:02:20,290 --> 00:02:24,005
Ab kahani se sabut ki taraf chalte hain. Sawaal seedha hai,

50
00:02:24,005 --> 00:02:26,706
kya yeh khamba sach mein hawa mein hai?

51
00:02:26,706 --> 00:02:29,745
Iske liye humein khambe ko dhyaan se dekhna hoga.

52
00:02:29,745 --> 00:02:33,460
Aur samajhna hoga ki yeh mandir aur iski chhat bani kaise.

53
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:36,498
Yeh mandir Vijayanagara samrajya ke daur ka hai.

54
00:02:36,498 --> 00:02:40,675
Vijayanagara yaani dakshin Bharat ka bada samrajya, jiski rajdhani Hampi thi.

55
00:02:40,675 --> 00:02:44,473
Is samrajya ke kaarigar patthar ke kaam mein mashhoor the.

56
00:02:44,473 --> 00:02:49,030
Unke mandir aaj bhi apni barik nakkashi ke liye jaane jaate hain.

57
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:50,733
Khamba granite ka bana hai.

58
00:02:50,733 --> 00:02:53,118
Granite yaani bahut sakht aur bhaari patthar,

59
00:02:53,118 --> 00:02:55,503
jo dakshin Bharat mein khoob milta hai.

60
00:02:55,503 --> 00:02:58,909
Is patthar ko kaatna aur tarashna aasan kaam nahi tha.

61
00:02:58,909 --> 00:03:00,953
Aur jab patthar itna bhaari ho,

62
00:03:00,953 --> 00:03:04,360
toh use hawa mein tikana aur bhi mushkil lagta hai.

63
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,261
Yeh khamba mandap mein hai.

64
00:03:06,261 --> 00:03:08,923
Mandap yaani khambon par tika khula hall,

65
00:03:08,923 --> 00:03:11,204
jahan log baithte aur utsav hote.

66
00:03:11,204 --> 00:03:14,626
Lepakshi ke is mandap mein bahut saare khambe hain.

67
00:03:14,626 --> 00:03:18,049
Khambon par nartakiyon, sangeetkaaron aur devtaon ki nakkashi hai,

68
00:03:18,049 --> 00:03:20,330
jo dekhne mein jeevit lagti hai.

69
00:03:20,330 --> 00:03:24,205
Ab sabse zaroori sabut. Jab khambe ki physical jaanch hui,

70
00:03:24,205 --> 00:03:27,305
yaani use paas se naapa aur dekha gaya,

71
00:03:27,305 --> 00:03:31,567
toh tasveer badal gayi. Khamba poori tarah hawa mein nahi hai.

72
00:03:31,567 --> 00:03:34,667
Iska kona, halka sa, zameen ko chhoota hai.

73
00:03:34,667 --> 00:03:37,380
Yahi is raaz ki pehli chaabi hai.

74
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:40,049
Socho, jab aap kapda neeche se nikaalte ho,

75
00:03:40,049 --> 00:03:43,384
toh woh zyaadatar hisse ke neeche se nikal jaata hai.

76
00:03:43,384 --> 00:03:45,719
Isliye lagta hai khamba latak raha hai.

77
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:49,389
Lekin kone par patthar aur zameen ka sampark bana rehta hai.

78
00:03:49,389 --> 00:03:51,390
Bhram yahin se paida hota hai.

79
00:03:51,390 --> 00:03:53,613
Archaeological Survey of India, yaani ASI,

80
00:03:53,613 --> 00:03:56,577
desh ke purane smarakon ki dekhbhaal karti hai.

81
00:03:56,577 --> 00:04:00,281
Lepakshi ka Veerabhadra mandir bhi ASI ki suraksha mein hai.

82
00:04:00,281 --> 00:04:03,615
Isliye khambe ko todna ya hilana aaj mana hai.

83
00:04:03,615 --> 00:04:07,320
Jaanch bhi bahut sambhal kar, bina nuksaan ke hoti hai.

84
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:11,678
Toh sabse bada sabut yeh hai ki khamba gravity ko chunauti nahi deta.

85
00:04:11,678 --> 00:04:13,019
Gravity yaani woh khinchav,

86
00:04:13,019 --> 00:04:16,036
jo har cheez ko zameen ki taraf kheenchta hai.

87
00:04:16,036 --> 00:04:17,713
Khamba zameen ko chhoota hai,

88
00:04:17,713 --> 00:04:20,730
bas itna kam ki aankh dhokha kha jaati hai.

89
00:04:20,730 --> 00:04:24,211
Ab sawaal aata hai, agar khamba poora bojh nahi uthata,

90
00:04:24,211 --> 00:04:25,952
toh chhat kaise tiki hai?

91
00:04:25,952 --> 00:04:28,389
Jawab chhat ki banawat mein chhupa hai.

92
00:04:28,389 --> 00:04:30,478
Is mandap ki chhat corbelled hai,

93
00:04:30,478 --> 00:04:32,567
aur dry-stone tareeke se bani hai.

94
00:04:32,567 --> 00:04:35,700
Chaliye in shabdon ko aasan bhasha mein samajhte hain.

95
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:37,549
Corbel yaani patthar ke upar patthar,

96
00:04:37,549 --> 00:04:40,940
har parat thodi aage nikal kar rakhna. Aise parat dar parat,

97
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:43,098
patthar beech mein aakar mil jaate hain.

98
00:04:43,098 --> 00:04:45,872
Isse chhat ka vazan seedha neeche girne ki bajaye,

99
00:04:45,872 --> 00:04:48,030
bagal ke saharon par baant jaata hai.

100
00:04:48,030 --> 00:04:51,512
Dry-stone yaani patthar jode gaye bina gare ya cement ke.

101
00:04:51,512 --> 00:04:55,343
Na choona, na masala, bas patthar ka patthar par sahi baithna.

102
00:04:55,343 --> 00:04:58,129
Kaarigar patthar ko itni barikee se tarashte the,

103
00:04:58,129 --> 00:05:01,960
ki woh apne vazan se hi aapas mein phans jaate the.

104
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:02,612
Ab socho,

105
00:05:02,612 --> 00:05:06,853
mandap ke saare khambe aapas mein jude jaal ki tarah kaam karte hain.

106
00:05:06,853 --> 00:05:10,114
Upar ki chhat in sab par bojh baant deti hai.

107
00:05:10,114 --> 00:05:12,397
Isliye kisi khambe ka thoda sa hatna,

108
00:05:12,397 --> 00:05:15,007
poori chhat ko nahi girata. Jaal mazboot ho,

109
00:05:15,007 --> 00:05:17,290
toh kamzor kadi bhi tiki rehti hai.

110
00:05:17,290 --> 00:05:20,418
Yahi Vijayanagara kaarigaron ki asli kamaal ki baat hai.

111
00:05:20,418 --> 00:05:23,545
Unke paas aaj ke computer ya machine nahi the.

112
00:05:23,545 --> 00:05:27,715
Phir bhi unhone aisa dhancha banaya jo bojh ko barabar baant de.

113
00:05:27,715 --> 00:05:30,148
Latakta khamba isi dhanche ki jhalak hai,

114
00:05:30,148 --> 00:05:32,580
jo aaj bhi humein hairan karti hai.

115
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:35,886
Toh banaya kaise gaya hoga? Sabse sambhavit tareeka yeh hai.

116
00:05:35,886 --> 00:05:37,870
Shuru mein khambe khade kiye gaye,

117
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:40,845
phir upar beam aur chhat ke patthar rakhe gaye.

118
00:05:40,845 --> 00:05:44,482
Jab chhat poori judi, toh bojh saare jaal mein bant gaya.

119
00:05:44,482 --> 00:05:49,110
Tab kisi khambe ka neeche se thoda hatna bhi chhat ko girne nahi deta.

120
00:05:49,110 --> 00:05:51,278
Ab aata hai sabse dilchasp hissa.

121
00:05:51,278 --> 00:05:53,806
Khamba zameen se thoda upar kyon hai?

122
00:05:53,806 --> 00:05:56,696
Is par jaankaron ki raay alag alag hai.

123
00:05:56,696 --> 00:05:59,947
Aur har paksh ke paas apna tark hai. Chaliye,

124
00:05:59,947 --> 00:06:03,560
sabut ke saath dono raayein suniye, bina jaldi faisla kiye.

125
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:07,379
Kuch jaankar kehte hain, yeh jaan boojh kar banaya gaya tha.

126
00:06:07,379 --> 00:06:09,463
Kaarigar apni kala dikhana chahte the.

127
00:06:09,463 --> 00:06:12,935
Woh batana chahte the ki unki chhat itni mazboot hai,

128
00:06:12,935 --> 00:06:16,060
ki khamba bina poore sahare ke bhi tika rahe.

129
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:18,490
Yaani soch samajh kar banaya gaya ajooba.

130
00:06:18,490 --> 00:06:20,371
Baaki jaankar alag baat kehte hain.

131
00:06:20,371 --> 00:06:24,134
Unke hisaab se khamba shuru mein poori tarah zameen par tika tha.

132
00:06:24,134 --> 00:06:27,897
Phir samay ke saath neeche ki zameen asmaan roop se baith gayi.

133
00:06:27,897 --> 00:06:29,779
Ise neev ka baithna kehte hain,

134
00:06:29,779 --> 00:06:31,660
yaani zameen ka dheere dheere dabna.

135
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:34,267
Is paksh ke paas aur bhi tark hai.

136
00:06:34,267 --> 00:06:37,199
Bhookamp ke halke jhatke, jinhe seismic tremors kehte hain,

137
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:39,154
sadiyon mein kai baar aaye honge.

138
00:06:39,154 --> 00:06:42,738
Aise jhatke dheere dheere bhaari pattharon ko bhi hila sakte hain.

139
00:06:42,738 --> 00:06:45,670
Shayad isi se khamba apni jagah se sarak gaya.

140
00:06:45,670 --> 00:06:49,155
Toh sabut wahi hai, par padhne ke tareeke alag hain.

141
00:06:49,155 --> 00:06:51,944
Kuch log ise kaarigaron ka iraada maante hain.

142
00:06:51,944 --> 00:06:55,080
Kuch ise samay aur zameen ka asar maante hain.

143
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:59,960
Abhi tak koi paksh baaki ko poori tarah galat saabit nahi kar paaya hai.

144
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:03,299
Aur yahan hum koi faisla nahi sunayenge. Aap khud socho,

145
00:07:03,299 --> 00:07:05,970
kya itne nipun kaarigar galti se aisa chhodte?

146
00:07:05,970 --> 00:07:09,642
Ya phir sadiyon ki zameen aur jhatkon ne apna khel khela?

147
00:07:09,642 --> 00:07:11,979
Har jawab apne aap mein dilchasp hai,

148
00:07:11,979 --> 00:07:14,650
aur har jawab kaarigaron ki mehnat dikhata hai.

149
00:07:14,650 --> 00:07:17,917
Ab woh kahani, jo sabse zyada sunayi jaati hai.

150
00:07:17,917 --> 00:07:20,095
Kehte hain angrezon ke zamane mein,

151
00:07:20,095 --> 00:07:23,000
koi angrez engineer is raaz ko kholne aaya.

152
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:27,719
Woh jaanna chahta tha ki chhat ko asal mein kaun sambhaal raha hai.

153
00:07:27,719 --> 00:07:30,260
Aur usne khambe ko hi pakad liya.

154
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:31,596
Lok katha ke mutabik,

155
00:07:31,596 --> 00:07:34,601
usne khambe ko hatane ya hilane ki koshish ki.

156
00:07:34,601 --> 00:07:36,604
Khamba apni jagah se khisak gaya,

157
00:07:36,604 --> 00:07:40,277
aur tab se thoda tirchha latak raha hai. Kahani kehti hai,

158
00:07:40,277 --> 00:07:43,950
chhat hilne lagi aur engineer ne darr kar kaam rok diya.

159
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:44,934
Lekin dhyan dijiye,

160
00:07:44,934 --> 00:07:47,884
is kahani ka koi pukhta sabut nahi mila hai.

161
00:07:47,884 --> 00:07:51,163
Kisi engineer ne sach mein khambe ko chheda ya nahi,

162
00:07:51,163 --> 00:07:53,130
yeh aaj tak saabit nahi hua.

163
00:07:53,130 --> 00:07:56,081
Isliye hum ise legend ke khaane mein rakhte hain,

164
00:07:56,081 --> 00:07:57,720
itihaas ke khaane mein nahi.

165
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,962
Ab baat karte hain un sawaalon ki,

166
00:07:59,962 --> 00:08:01,883
jinke jawab abhi bhi adhure hain.

167
00:08:01,883 --> 00:08:05,406
Khamba jaan boojh kar latkaya gaya, ya baad mein khisak gaya?

168
00:08:05,406 --> 00:08:07,648
Is par aakhri faisla abhi baaki hai.

169
00:08:07,648 --> 00:08:10,850
Aur shayad naye sabut aane par hi yeh gutthi suljhegi.

170
00:08:10,850 --> 00:08:12,217
Aur bhi sawaal hai.

171
00:08:12,217 --> 00:08:16,319
Is mandap ki chhat bagal ke dhakke ko kitna jhel sakti hai,

172
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:20,078
iska poora hisaab nahi hua. Bagal ka dhakka yaani lateral load,

173
00:08:20,078 --> 00:08:24,180
jo bhookamp ya tez hawa se patthar ko side mein dhakelta hai.

174
00:08:24,180 --> 00:08:27,695
Matlab, Vijayanagara ke kaarigaron ne kitni mazbooti haasil ki,

175
00:08:27,695 --> 00:08:30,819
yeh abhi tak poori tarah naapa nahi gaya.

176
00:08:30,819 --> 00:08:33,162
Shayad aage ki research ise kholegi.

177
00:08:33,162 --> 00:08:37,068
Tab tak yeh khamba sawaal bankar khada hai, ya kahein,

178
00:08:37,068 --> 00:08:38,630
sawaal bankar latka hai.

179
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:42,512
Ab aapke kaam ki baat. Agar aap Lepakshi jaana chahte hain,

180
00:08:42,512 --> 00:08:46,041
toh kya kya dekhein? Yeh gaon Andhra Pradesh mein hai,

181
00:08:46,041 --> 00:08:48,511
aur mandir aaj bhi poojit hai. Jaayein,

182
00:08:48,511 --> 00:08:52,040
toh shraddha aur mandir ke niyam ka poora dhyan rakhein.

183
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:54,371
Mandap mein jaakar latakta khamba dekhiye.

184
00:08:54,371 --> 00:08:57,868
Log aaj bhi uske neeche se kapda nikaalte hain,

185
00:08:57,868 --> 00:09:01,753
aur ise shubh maante hain. Yeh aastha ki parampara hai.

186
00:09:01,753 --> 00:09:06,027
Bas dhyan rahe, purane patthar ko dhakka ya nuksaan na pahunche,

187
00:09:06,027 --> 00:09:07,970
kyunki yeh dharohar sabki hai.

188
00:09:07,970 --> 00:09:10,799
Deewar par Virupanna ki aankhon wale nishaan dhoondhiye.

189
00:09:10,799 --> 00:09:13,628
Chhat aur khambon ki rang birangi chitrakari dekhiye.

190
00:09:13,628 --> 00:09:18,225
Aur mandir ke paas granite se bani vishal Nandi ki moorti zaroor dekhiye,

191
00:09:18,225 --> 00:09:20,700
jo door se hi nazar aati hai.

192
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:24,416
Toh aakhir mein sabut kya kehta hai? Khamba hawa mein nahi,

193
00:09:24,416 --> 00:09:25,767
par lagbhag latakta hai.

194
00:09:25,767 --> 00:09:29,145
Chhat ka bojh khambon ke jaal par bant jaata hai.

195
00:09:29,145 --> 00:09:32,523
Aur yeh jaan boojh kar tha ya samay ka asar,

196
00:09:32,523 --> 00:09:34,550
yeh abhi bhi khula sawaal hai.

197
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:38,524
Ab aapse seedha sawaal. Aapko kya lagta hai,

198
00:09:38,524 --> 00:09:41,505
yeh khamba kaarigaron ka iraada tha,

199
00:09:41,505 --> 00:09:45,975
ya zameen ke baithne ka asar? Comment mein bataiye.

200
00:09:45,975 --> 00:09:49,950
